<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea NLCF to seek 53,000T oilseed meal Tuesday.</title>
<headline>S.Korea NLCF to seek 53,000T oilseed meal Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) said on Monday it would invite tenders to buy 13,000 tonnes of rapeseed meal, 10,000 tonnes of ricebran, 10,000 tonnes of palm meal and 20,000 tonnes of copra by 11 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Details for the planned tenders are as follows:</p>
<p> COMMOD    TONNE	SHIPMENT		  ETA    ARRIVAL PORT</p>
<p> Rapemeal  6,000  Mar 15-Apr 3 (India)	Apr 20 Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p>			Mar 27-Apr 15 (China)     Apr 20 Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p> Rapemeal  7,000  Mar 24-Apr 13 (India)     Apr 20 Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p>			Apr 6-25 (China)	    Apr 30 Inchon</p>
<p> Ricebran 10,000  Feb 26-Mar 13 (India)     Mar 30 Inchon/Kunsan</p>
<p> Palm     10,000  Feb 26-Mar 17 (S.E.Asia)  Mar 30 Inchon/</p>
<p>								  Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p> Copra    10,000  Feb 26-Mar 17 (S.E.Asia)  Mar 30 Inchon/</p>
<p>								  Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p> Copra    10,000  Mar 29-Apr 17 (S.E.Asia)  Apr 30 Inchon/</p>
<p>								  Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
